.\autonomous\99_total\PROMPT_guideline.md:890:| `route-quality-grade` / timed route-switch verdict | `Route-switch benchmark verdict` | `Route re-prioritization audit memo` | `Route-quality scorecard`, `Packet compliance report` | use `advisory route note`, `reprioritization audit`, or `exploration note` | use `switch-timing verdict only`; avoid wider route-quality generalization | audit / completeness only; scorecard stays background support | keep alternative route branches and fallback timing split |
